  "description": "Nestled within a quiet and exclusive cul-de-sac of Flemington Lane, this 3-bedroom mid terrace property is sure to stir interest. \n\nUpon entering the property, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway, setting the tone for the well-presented accommodation throughout. To the front of the home is a spacious living room, flooded with natural light from the attractive bay window, creating a warm and comfortable space for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nTo the rear, the open-plan kitchen/dining room offers an excellent family living space, with ample room for both cooking and dining. A door from the dining area provides direct access to the rear garden, seamlessly blending indoor and outdoor living. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property boasts three generously proportioned bedrooms, all offering excellent storage and natural light. The principal bedroom benefits from its own en-suite shower room, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a well-appointed family bathroom, complete with a bath, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nThis well-designed home offers bright, spacious accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families or those looking to downsize without compromising on space. \n\nIdeally located in the highly regarded New Haven development, No. 4 New Haven Court enjoys a superb setting within walking distance of an excellent range of amenities. From shopping centres, cafés and restaurants to schools and leisure facilities, everything required for modern family living is close at hand.\n\nBalbriggan continues to grow as one of North Dublin's most desirable coastal towns, offering a wealth of sporting and recreational activities including golf, GAA, rugby, sailing and windsurfing. The nearby Ardgillan Castle & Demesne provides beautiful parkland, woodland trails and spectacular coastal views for all to enjoy.\n\nFor those commuting, the location is second to none. Regular rail and bus services connect Balbriggan with Dublin City Centre, with many buses departing from Millfield Shopping Centre via the Port Tunnel. The M1 motorway is only minutes away, placing Dublin Airport within approximately 20 minutes and the city centre within a 30-minute drive.\n\n\nViewing is highly recommended\n\n\n\n\nProperty Features\n•\t3-bedroom mid terrace home \n•\tB rated\n•\tUtility room \n•\tDownstairs WC\n•\tPrime location just minutes` walk from two shopping centres and all local amenities\n•\tExcellent transport links to Dublin city centre via bus and rail",
